{"id": "UgwNOiHtgYZwbiPTqnZ4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "01 Breath of Incense (⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐)\n02 Silent Tiger Presence (⭐⭐)\n03 Temple Stillness (⭐⭐)\n00 Path Without Thought\n04 Inner Balance (⭐)\n05 Calm Awareness (⭐⭐⭐⭐)\n06 Flow of the Way (⭐⭐⭐⭐)\n07 Quiet Strength (⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐)\n08 Return Within (⭐⭐⭐)\n09 Endless Stillness (⭐)\n00 Forest Meditation\n00 Quiet Devotion\n00 Path to the Torii\n10 Return to Balance (⭐⭐⭐)\n\n\"Silent Tiger Presence\" and \"Path to the Torii\" are the same song. \"Temple Stillness\" and \"Forest Meditation\" are the same song. \"Path Without Thought\" and \"Quiet Strength\" and \"Quiet Devotion\" are the same song. These fake names are your lies.💩 Haven't you ever heard of a principle? Quality over quantity.\n\nIn the repeating list, \"Breath of Incense\" should serve as the starting item, but it's missing.\n\n\"Quiet Strength\" sounds like an unfinished piece of music.\n\nPlease do not misuse or abuse our Chinese Dao(道), culture and Chinese music, Mr Hikari Zen.", "published": "2026-06-07T16:50:30", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
